WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:03.207
Read a course card: One compact card, all the important details.

2
00:00:03.207 --> 00:00:08.926
Course marker: Color is based on the course code. Circle: exam data. Square: no exam data.

3
00:00:08.926 --> 00:00:13.644
Median: The smaller number is the historical median grade, when available.

4
00:00:13.644 --> 00:00:18.294
Credits: The bold number is the credit value of the course.

5
00:00:18.294 --> 00:00:22.978
Course name: The name stays readable for up to three lines. Open the course to see all its details.

6
00:00:22.978 --> 00:00:27.678
Course code: The code uniquely identifies the course, including its leading zeroes.

7
00:00:27.678 --> 00:00:39.563
Requirement warnings: Open the warning to check prerequisites, corequisites, exclusions, or semester availability.
